   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Up On A Hill**: back after 328 archived shows (3745 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Push Th' Little Daises**: back after 136 archived shows (1810 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Fancy Pants**: back after 123 archived shows (1749 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **The Goin' Gets Touch**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Mister Won't You Please Help My Pony**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2010-09-17.salvo** (recommended): source not stated; 34 songs; 150 min [1]\n- **ween2010-09-17**: source not stated; 34 songs; 145 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2010-09-17.salvo**: taped by Mike Salvo; transferred by Mike Salvo; source: AKG se300b/ck91>Edirol UA-5 (bm2p+)>iRiver h120 [1]\n- **ween2010-09-17**: taped by Cousinit; transferred by Cousinit; source: Denon DTR80P w/Nakamichi 300's + CP4 Shotguns [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Kurt Koller: [Ween in Central Park ~ Kurt Koller](https://www.sarcasm.com/ween-central-park/) [4]\n- Poster by Original Concert Posters: [WEEN Concert Poster Central Park NYC 2010 Foil AP Jermaine Rogers](https://originalconcertposters.org/2026/01/ween-concert-poster-central-park-nyc-2010-foil-ap-jermaine-rogers/) [5]\n- Poster by original-concert-posters.com: [WEEN Concert Poster Central Park NYC 2010 Foil AP Jermaine Rogers | Original Concert Posters](https://original-concert-posters.com/2026/01/14/ween-concert-poster-central-park-nyc-2010-foil-ap-jermaine-rogers/) [6]\n- Poster by original-concert-posters.com: [WEEN Concert Poster Central Park NYC 2010 Foil AP Jermaine Rogers | Original Concert Posters](https://original-concert-posters.com/2026/01/14/ween-concert-poster-central-park-nyc-2010-foil-ap-jermaine-rogers/) [7]",
